From 429fb7b16bb9f5d01df8a402eb73f7e9e04ee931 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: diamondStar35 <ramymaherali55@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:09:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: handle faded pause, play and seek in the native core

Add fade-pause, fade-play and fade-seek with core-thread completion scheduling. Coalesce seek destinations, retain pause intent, arm fade-in before output starts, and reverse fades at the current gain. Release holds after failed seeks and cancel pending actions on ordinary transport changes.
